# Token policy — no raw hex

⛔ Never write raw hex values in component or story code.

| Figma hex | ✅ Use token |
|---|---|
| `#1976d2` | `var(--primary)` = `#1E44CC` |
| `#de1b0c` | `var(--destructive)` = `#d4183d` |
| `#212121` | `var(--foreground)` |
| `#555555` / `#8f8f8f` | `var(--muted-foreground)` |
| `#f2f4f7` / `#eaeaea` | `var(--muted)` / `var(--border)` |
| `#e5e9f0` | `var(--accent)` |
| `#ffffff` | `var(--background)` or `var(--card)` |

Chart colors use `var(--graph-*)` — see graph-colors.mdc.
Exception: story demo scaffolding may use hex.
